      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a relief deployment plan for the coast after the hurricane hits. We have limited supplies and need to decide where to prioritize our main hubs to ensure the fastest recovery. Can you help me analyze which types of community profiles would offer the highest \"success rate\" for these interventions in terms of long-term economic stability and efficient resource utilization? I want to make sure we aren't wasting supplies on areas that might struggle to rebuild regardless of the aid.",
