    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense from a logistics standpoint. Give me some concrete examples of what those profiles look like in this region. For instance, if we're looking at a suburban district with a higher median income and a high percentage of white professionals versus an urban district that's more ethnically diverse and has a higher density of low-income, service-sector workers... which one fits your criteria for a \"better investment\" for long-term recovery?",
